OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash at PMQs over
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham and Kemi Badenoch clash
OL,7,Fover the government's new EU deal at
OL,8,FPMQs
OL,10,FBadenoch asks whether the deal - on
OL,11,Fyouth mobility, food exports and
OL,12,Femissions trading - is contingent on
OL,13,Ftalks about lowering tuition fees paid
OL,14,Fby EU students in the UK
OL,16,FBurnham says the tuition fee agreement
OL,17,F"is not done" - citing the president of
OL,18,Fthe European Commission as saying "it's
OL,19,Fon a separate piece of paper" to the
OL,20,Fone agreed on Friday
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
