OL,3,ABurnham and Badenoch clash at PMQs over
OL,4,Auniversity fees for EU students in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FBadenoch says the PM will "end up
OL,7,Fgiving the whole country away" unless
OL,8,Fchallenged - Burnham says the new deal
OL,9,Fis the "biggest growth measure we could
OL,10,Ftake in this Parliament"
OL,12,FAway from the EU, Badenoch criticises
OL,13,Fthe PM for inviting social media
OL,14,Finfluencers to Downing Street after a
OL,15,Frow erupted over a TikTok video one of
OL,16,Fthem posted
OL,18,FBadenoch says the content was
OL,19,F"offensive" - Burnham says the language
OL,20,Fin the video was "not acceptable" but
OL,21,Fhe will not apologise for working with
OL,22,Fthose who reach younger people
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
